{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Frost Protocol",
    "steam_appid": 3706210,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cold, deadly world. Merciless. Brutal. Hostile to life. Those who want to survive here will carry scars \u2014 and only those who plan ahead stand a chance of escaping the Frost Protocol.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706210/extras/c7fdc82a2df978f9ccac5f19cd0103e5.poster.avif?t=1754327435\" width=800 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706210/extras/c7fdc82a2df978f9ccac5f19cd0103e5.webm?t=1754327435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706210/extras/c7fdc82a2df978f9ccac5f19cd0103e5.mp4?t=1754327435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT FOR SURVIVAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous dangers await you and your survivors. Make sure you have enough food, oxygen and protection from the relentless cold. But even then, stress, fatigue, and injury might break you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HANDCRAFTED CHARACTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People aren\u2019t stats. They have pasts, personalities, and fears. Every single one of them has their own story to tell. Different skills, personality traits and a moral compass influence the game. Not all of them will accept your choices.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STRATEGIC BASE MANAGEMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign your survivors to different stations. Whether workshop, generator or engine room: each station ensures your survival. Repairs and upgrades keep your base running, but the lack of resources will force you to make difficult decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706210/extras/98816c89c47732e620ee632fe09fb42b.poster.avif?t=1754327435\" width=960 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706210/extras/98816c89c47732e620ee632fe09fb42b.webm?t=1754327435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706210/extras/98816c89c47732e620ee632fe09fb42b.mp4?t=1754327435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TACTICAL REALTIME COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you manage your base at night, you embark on dangerous expeditions during the day to gather resources for research and upgrades. In tactical battles, you defend your survivors with powerful combat robots. Explore the icy world and its history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706210/extras/b43beddc481842ddce9dd0823279caef.poster.avif?t=1754327435\" width=800 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706210/extras/b43beddc481842ddce9dd0823279caef.webm?t=1754327435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706210/extras/b43beddc481842ddce9dd0823279caef.mp4?t=1754327435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ROBOT MANAGEMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, upgrade and repair your combat robots. Choose the best setup for each upcoming expedition from various robot types and abilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PERMADEATH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether human or robot - the loss is permanent. Learn to deal with it - learn to make sacrifices.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It's not about winning, it's about <u>not</u> losing.</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cold, deadly world. Merciless. Brutal. Hostile to life. Those who want to survive here will carry scars \u2014 and only those who plan ahead stand a chance of escaping the Frost Protocol.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706210/extras/c7fdc82a2df978f9ccac5f19cd0103e5.poster.avif?t=1754327435\" width=800 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706210/extras/c7fdc82a2df978f9ccac5f19cd0103e5.webm?t=1754327435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706210/extras/c7fdc82a2df978f9ccac5f19cd0103e5.mp4?t=1754327435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT FOR SURVIVAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous dangers await you and your survivors. Make sure you have enough food, oxygen and protection from the relentless cold. But even then, stress, fatigue, and injury might break you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HANDCRAFTED CHARACTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People aren\u2019t stats. They have pasts, personalities, and fears. Every single one of them has their own story to tell. Different skills, personality traits and a moral compass influence the game. Not all of them will accept your choices.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STRATEGIC BASE MANAGEMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign your survivors to different stations. Whether workshop, generator or engine room: each station ensures your survival. Repairs and upgrades keep your base running, but the lack of resources will force you to make difficult decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706210/extras/98816c89c47732e620ee632fe09fb42b.poster.avif?t=1754327435\" width=960 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706210/extras/98816c89c47732e620ee632fe09fb42b.webm?t=1754327435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706210/extras/98816c89c47732e620ee632fe09fb42b.mp4?t=1754327435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TACTICAL REALTIME COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you manage your base at night, you embark on dangerous expeditions during the day to gather resources for research and upgrades. In tactical battles, you defend your survivors with powerful combat robots. Explore the icy world and its history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706210/extras/b43beddc481842ddce9dd0823279caef.poster.avif?t=1754327435\" width=800 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706210/extras/b43beddc481842ddce9dd0823279caef.webm?t=1754327435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706210/extras/b43beddc481842ddce9dd0823279caef.mp4?t=1754327435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ROBOT MANAGEMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, upgrade and repair your combat robots. Choose the best setup for each upcoming expedition from various robot types and abilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PERMADEATH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether human or robot - the loss is permanent. Learn to deal with it - learn to make sacrifices.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It's not about winning, it's about <u>not</u> losing.</h2>",
    "short_description": "Manage a small group of survivors in this tactical strategy game. Upgrade your station, enhance your combat robots, and build an outpost. Fight against harsh conditions, rising stress levels, and deadly monsters. This isn\u2019t about winning - it\u2019s about not losing.",
